<div class="topline"><span>WORK MANAGEMENT</span><span>Plan. Build. Finish.</span></div><header class="page-header"><div><span class="website-kicker">LIFEOS WORK</span><h1>Give your work a clear path.</h1><p class="muted">Projects, work items, cycles and notes, together in your local workspace.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="#new-workspace">+ Workspace</a></header><?php require ROOT.'/app/Core/views/notices.php'; ?>
